  m_Name: VerseTwo_DialogueData 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Messages:
  - Faith isn't only made of reverence and philosophy. Grief and agony shapes faith
    as well.
  - 'When it''s dark out, Death creeps up and greets those of the living with an
    unfortunate end. The Moon knows this well. '
  - What statement expresses despair most accurately?
  ButtonOneText: We bring before thee our despair, the grief of those taken by shadow.
  ButtonTwoText: We bring before thee our despair and search for Her Grace's divine
    light for salvation.
  ButtonThreeText: We bury our sorrow and cower in darkness, for grief is unworthy
    of thy radiant and eternal gaze.
  correctButtonNumber: 1
